menu "ZHIHE SoC drivers"

config A210_MEMTESTER
	tristate "ZHIHE A210 memtester support"
	default y
	help
	  This driver supports A210 memtester feature for DDR
	  memory verification. It provides a way to test and
	  validate DDR memory integrity on the ZhiHe A210 SoC.
	  Say Y or M here if you need DDR memory testing support.

config A210_POWER_DOMAIN
	bool "A210 Power Domain driver"
	depends on PM
	select PM_GENERIC_DOMAINS
	default n
	help
	  This is the power domain driver that controls PCU/PPU for
	  the A210 SoC. It manages power gating of various hardware
	  subsystems to reduce overall power consumption.
	  Say Y here if you are building a kernel for the ZhiHe A210.

config A210_BMU
	tristate "A210 bmu driver"
	default n
	help
	  This driver provides support for the A210 Bus Monitor Unit
	  (BMU). It enables bus performance monitoring and tracing
	  for debugging and profiling purposes.
	  Say Y or M here if you need BMU bus monitoring support.

config ZH_IOPMP
	tristate "ZhiHe iopmp Support"
	depends on ARCH_ZHIHE || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Say Y here to include support for zhihe iopmp found on
	  A210 fullmask devices.
	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called zh-iopmp.

endmenu
